<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Air Products EPS view up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Air Products EPS view up.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Thursday it increased its EPS estimates on Air Products and Chemicals Inc by $0.03 per share to $3.70 for FY97. For FY98, it estimates $4.25 per share.</p>
<p>--EVEREN acted after Air Products reported 1996 Q4 earnings of $0.85 per share, exceeding its $0.82 per share estimate.</p>
<p>--Air Products was trading at 59-3/4, off 7/8.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
